{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "e21e4188a23e31f85b22601800bacbfe0905c86460ad2d630591fd1da367887d", "ja": "名刺交換会！", "zh": "名片交换会！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "6390ca3637ffa07f400884364ea964377b59fa0e2842aff88e572600be5de95a", "ja": "CD販売イベントも中盤戦。各チームの売上\nはほぼ互角。そんな中、昴は遠くから様子を\n窺う一人の男性に気付く。男性は、瑞希の\n父だった。そこに雪歩の父がお弟子さん達を\n連れて現れ、CDを購入するのだった。", "zh": "CD发售活动也进入了中盘战。各队的销量\n旗鼓相当。就在这时，昴注意到有一位男性\n正在远处窥探着这边。而那名男性正是瑞希的\n父亲。随后雪步的父亲带着弟子们\n现身，买下了CD。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_03_1000_p", "source_sha256": "3ac27fa0143e71f61ecf0d89319dfe535939ffef25bfb312cb98d996481e1dc8", "ja": "（CD販売イベントも、そろそろ中盤戦に突入。\n各チーム、いい感じに数字を伸ばしてきている）", "zh": "（CD销售活动也差不多进入中场了。各队的数字都在稳步增长，势头相当不错）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_03_1001_p", "source_sha256": "e6f864602f049198f015dc03edd5a16a3d7f773d66df6e8aee6f31fdc70bb13f", "ja": "（これまでのところは、ほとんど互角。\n後は、何か爆発するようなきっかけでもあれば……）", "zh": "（到目前为止，双方几乎势均力敌。接下来要是能有个一举爆发的契机就好了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_03_1002_047sub", "source_sha256": "6b35acc3ffe169176ffa10b26458da38c39802d48d662ba656f5aae95ec3ebd3", "ja": "ふぅ～。列、やっと落ち着いたな！\nこんなに来てくれるとは思わなかったぜ♪", "zh": "呼～，队伍总算稳定下来了！\n没想到会有这么多人来啊♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_03_1003_047sub", "source_sha256": "a433e65673a2571a4a7670384fe2d2c6c38f2e0819a5e5b4fc20cfab3eaea9c4", "ja": "今日、いい感じじゃないか？\n瑞希の手品で、みんな立ち止まってくれるし！", "zh": "今天感觉不错吧？\n多亏了瑞希的魔术，大家都会停下脚步！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_03_1004_044miz", "source_sha256": "d3b1ff35e7c4c2d95a30cf554999658faa47ae2c7fa9fff1a8fcb166057ad2e9", "ja": "はい。しかしやはり、この時間帯は\n暇になってしまいますね。……エアポケット。", "zh": "是的。不过果然，到了这个时间段还是会变得很闲呢。……像是掉进了气流空洞。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_03_1005_047sub", "source_sha256": "a5ba7b2958475fe1270cd405d8bba89623eba65981cb536765f6b7c282810f49", "ja": "こういう時に差をつけたいよな～。\n……あと、さっきから気になってたんだけどさ。", "zh": "这种时候就得拉开差距嘛～。\n……还有件事，我从刚才起就一直很在意。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_03_1006_047sub", "source_sha256": "0e626b0dee2bf7f1f65cdf514c4835afbe6386ae378d02b693347b8c872e8363", "ja": "あそこにいる人、さっきからずっとこっち見てないか？\nもしかして、CD買いたいのかな？", "zh": "那边那个人，是不是从刚才开始就一直在看我们这边？\n难道是想买CD？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_03_1007_047sub", "source_sha256": "20c1e8d6f2ae1cfb4f44e052e4c01a19f2a4eee9a3778368e94309d644d46738", "ja": "オレ、ちょっと声かけてくる！", "zh": "我去跟那个人搭个话！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_03_1008_p", "source_sha256": "cb9b3d9bedda54f74316d87e915910cf720807852f1422303f007b936864d544", "ja": "ん？　あれは……。", "zh": "嗯？那是……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_03_1010_047sub", "source_sha256": "cbfdb69c93a26e8b042e3ee58f464a6b4c9b9e5fcb6ad0b1fe44ba06db7e6134", "ja": "ほら、こっちこっち！　へへー、なんか\n気になってるみたいだったから、連れてきちゃったぜ♪", "zh": "你看，这边这边！嘿嘿，因为它好像很在意的样子，我就把它带来了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_03_1012_044miz", "source_sha256": "147dea38c2ddc493b95f088722bb5063fca46b2e78d9fe7f1cecc0695f06f9b4", "ja": "お父さん……どうして？", "zh": "爸爸……为什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_03_1013_p", "source_sha256": "5d5ca9f1fb3111a37c0475a83d03d648a2c8e5a44dcf09b0e9e4cda931235417", "ja": "ああ、やっぱり。\nいつもお世話になっております。", "zh": "啊，果然。\n一直以来承蒙您的关照。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_03_1014_047sub", "source_sha256": "0762586390bc0d84e7ad3fe4bbdd33e9d90396e6784cadb4296e3178e8537382", "ja": "えっ！？\nおじさん、瑞希のお父さんなの！？", "zh": "诶！？\n大叔，你是瑞希的爸爸吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_03_1015_047sub", "source_sha256": "afa10b2aac944bf86c81eb793eaf95572e9a33cdf195332abd8079de94e8a811", "ja": "全然知らなかった……。\n無理矢理連れてきちゃって、ごめんなさい！", "zh": "完全没想到……  \n对不起，硬把你带过来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_03_1016_mizukinotiti", "source_sha256": "5418bc66917280e8464851bc2fda88561237ee359367fc4c5d39417957dad6fc", "ja": "いや、むしろ君が声を掛けてくれて\n助かったよ。ありがとう。", "zh": "不，倒是多亏你叫住了我  \n帮大忙了。谢谢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_03_1017_mizukinotiti", "source_sha256": "6d754a63d964fb83d640e00f654e8e5ebe2056b5d5546ff7fbe49dfc588a1c51", "ja": "CDを買うつもりで来たんだけど、\nこういった場所の作法がわからなくて……。", "zh": "我本来是打算来买CD的，\n但不太懂这种地方的规矩……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_03_1018_mizukinotiti", "source_sha256": "35599fbba64aaa4c816c314ab0acea0d10c410dac241be7a30e9588603269c63", "ja": "けど、ちゃんと人が集まっていたみたいだな……\nこういう協力は必要なかったか。", "zh": "不过，看来人还是好好聚齐了……\n看来没必要进行这种协助啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_03_1019_044miz", "source_sha256": "c69d3d99c9ce3a1bf77e006764a26c28875c5a8aaef291d092bbf7b4fd8a26f9", "ja": "ううん、そんなことない。\n……うれしいよ。", "zh": "不，不是那样。\n……我很开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_03_1020_mizukinotiti", "source_sha256": "fe96b413c808e95399e2f3f7b7ae5316c11dbd0893c1e10e51247cbaaa03bbe1", "ja": "……そうか。", "zh": "……这样啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_03_1021_047sub", "source_sha256": "30edb5b47b1b24428e454ce933aa77894429581f64852c5177bbccbff6105301", "ja": "よかった～！\nでもそれなら、瑞希のとこで買ってってくれよな！", "zh": "太好了～！\n不过既然这样，就顺便去瑞希那里买嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_03_1022_mizukinotiti", "source_sha256": "7203160ac9327520666b9cb3e8ce2d7d5721cd1547898fc748ca4b7a75ad5fe9", "ja": "ああ、そうだ。「娘のCDを買いに行く」と言ったら、\n事務員さん達も一緒に来てくれたんだ。", "zh": "啊，对了。我说要去买女儿的CD后，事务员们也一起陪我来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_03_1023_044miz", "source_sha256": "73a38d5ecb750cdc5a89000b5fae64d113f73c6b53c0251bae977da4c94222c4", "ja": "なんと。わざわざありがとうございます。", "zh": "什么。还特意过来，真是谢谢您。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_03_1024_jimuina", "source_sha256": "21ebfe4fb88bdb85fa3523236c7ad4dbf9cd81d3cecfbe39155aed4304451d37", "ja": "こんにちは！　もう、真壁先生ったら……\n応援なんですから、もっと熱くいかないと！", "zh": "你好！真壁老师真是的……\n既然是来加油的，就得更热情一点才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_03_1025_jimuinb", "source_sha256": "673faaebe2c3e63bfdb61843602695ce8e91b7015fa0af0bb171574d3bd0502f", "ja": "本当ですよ！　頑張ってとか、一生推しますとか！\nまったく、法廷ならスラスラ話せるのに……。", "zh": "真的哦！比如“加油啊”或者“我一辈子都会支持你”之类的！\n真是的，明明在法庭上就能滔滔不绝地说个不停……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_03_1026_mizukinotiti", "source_sha256": "6b18d4f9e334530dd109db9d4d07f0e4b23c0895cdefbbfc3ef07bef3cdb2913", "ja": "いや、あれは仕事だから……。", "zh": "不，毕竟那是工作嘛……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_03_1027_mizukinotiti", "source_sha256": "19806048f2e421c2c90525048ec271185637cc4e1fc0b52f66282fe634351a15", "ja": "瑞希、新譜を1枚……いや、2枚買わせてもらおう。\n1枚は、お母さんの分だ。", "zh": "瑞希，我买新专辑1张……不，还是买2张吧。\n1张是给妈妈的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_03_1028_044miz", "source_sha256": "2c0ff400b1af2b8cc13106223df56ac03c6ae70700e70539b9adb3055ba2098d", "ja": "あ、はい。\n……お買い上げ、ありがとうございます。", "zh": "啊，好的。\n……谢谢您的购买。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_03_1029_jimuina", "source_sha256": "1c442762b9a14ee2fa639cec1542f08da34c53f33ec8f86f915a33b13538e2eb", "ja": "少しでも数字を伸ばそうと……。\n頑張りましたね、真壁先生……！", "zh": "想稍微提高一点数据……\n真壁老师，你很努力了呢……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_03_1030_jimuinb", "source_sha256": "b82d1800b5c33c28e58dd6c2936e3ff854e967de9a539c207d6ae8d435581ebf", "ja": "こういうイベントなら、\nたびたび来たっていいと思いますよ！", "zh": "这种活动的话，\n我觉得可以经常来参加哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_03_1031_mizukinotiti", "source_sha256": "71ba27b6476d2d06b310543c18756cdca203dad887a85d0e49d0831c8a40373b", "ja": "いや、それは迷惑だろう。\nこれきりにしておく。", "zh": "不，那样会给人添麻烦吧。\n就到此为止吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_03_1032_037nao", "source_sha256": "6e8e3621b3148813d5248b7e87347bc022778432b0236d9105e1ca5f14249690", "ja": "瑞希のお父さんって感じの人やな。\n物静かな感じとか、よう似とるわ。", "zh": "感觉就像瑞希的爸爸一样。\n安静沉稳的感觉也很像呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_03_1033_004yuk", "source_sha256": "9f4eb886964577d90bb4f838f9df341b5d22c067e455c28c264413d25b5b7540", "ja": "優しそうで、素敵なお父さんだよね……！\nなんだか、ほっこりしちゃうなぁ♪", "zh": "看起来是一位很温柔、很棒的父亲呢……！\n总觉得心里暖暖的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_03_1034_unknown2", "source_sha256": "53528958f202bf033699e4998f535259d11310f7d58c2a1c3a88824c081af2e0", "ja": "CDをもらおうか。", "zh": "去领CD吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_03_1035_037nao", "source_sha256": "862b0f727187e9a16c133a2b689ec998ab4865d60ac43531bae1ea369ecb0730", "ja": "まいどー！　ありがとうございます♪\nご希望は何枚です？", "zh": "多谢惠顾～！非常感谢♪\n您想要几张呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_03_1036_unknown2", "source_sha256": "8c800d70574b0053a0b9929a0ab52e62312a7dc8f200d3cabbe46b8008d0f87a", "ja": "萩原雪歩のCDを……お前ら、何人だ？", "zh": "萩原雪步的CD……你们，有几个人？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_03_1037_004yuk", "source_sha256": "5a04ff82561dda4129825f83262412c6527b2195abb38fcbd671bfec71201fee", "ja": "！！？\nお、お、お……お父さん！？　み、みんな……！", "zh": "！！？爸、爸、爸爸！？还、还有大家……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_03_1038_yukihof", "source_sha256": "d19162f12cc5e2a7017d765c9726756efda363dbdd9710321eef356f46a00c3b", "ja": "ああ、弟子も連れてきた。\nお前ら、わかってるな？　素人さんに迷惑かけるなよ。", "zh": "啊，还把徒弟也带来了。\n你们都明白吧？可别给这位新手添麻烦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_03_1039_odesisan", "source_sha256": "b393f1fa333e6d2db1b3544d1a36cdfde5c911e2bcf477118fe6aa758fd68951", "ja": "「「「はい！！」」」", "zh": "「「「是！！！」」」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_03_1040_odesisana", "source_sha256": "cc8a71a81006df181c88670b6e6b8201dff72e1fad6efe0c4b30d64f8b21e10b", "ja": "お嬢、1枚お願いしやす！", "zh": "小姐，麻烦来1张！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_03_1041_odesisanb", "source_sha256": "03da67dd02f0cc3609fda9930ea3a3653fe859ec4a841847b3ca825934767938", "ja": "お嬢、自分にも！", "zh": "大小姐，也给我一个！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_03_1042_004yuk", "source_sha256": "e510a68b816d4c093c7ccee19da09c9b488d937df506de6cf840f87d345d9749", "ja": "あ、ありがとうございますぅ……。\nうぅ、なんか変な感じ……。", "zh": "啊，谢谢您……  \n呜，总觉得有点奇怪……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_03_1043_037nao", "source_sha256": "1197a1c812d3c193c9bac07850d464334d9105381bd62253be886f574c9274c6", "ja": "雪歩のお父さん、こういう感じの人なんや。\nイメージとちゃうような、そうでもないような……。", "zh": "原来雪步的爸爸是这种感觉的人啊。\n好像和我想的不太一样，又好像没什么不同……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_03_1044_037nao", "source_sha256": "c4dd738fa87444a0fc15edcc0fabe4c7a3396da15e0505004898d507b6bcf029", "ja": "せやけどお弟子さんって、何の仕事しとるん？\nあ、もしかして伝統工芸の職人さん！？", "zh": "不过，你这位徒弟是做什么工作的？\n啊，难道是传统工艺匠人！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_03_1045_004yuk", "source_sha256": "9adfd84d59cfbaaaeaa77d851935dc88addeda27eef98e4de21ae0258ec6e406", "ja": "ち、違うの！　その、建築業で……。\nうぅ、まさかお父さん達が来るなんて……。", "zh": "不、不是的！那个……是做建筑工作的……\n呜，没想到爸爸他们居然会来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_03_1046_047sub", "source_sha256": "b957730a6c7d8e6f0571c0e3f17dc3a0db3802e468ccc03285887a95946efdcc", "ja": "へー、そうなんだ！\nでもお弟子さんって、なんかカッコいい響きだな♪", "zh": "哦——原来是这样！\n不过，“徒弟”听起来还挺帅气的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_03_1047_044miz", "source_sha256": "f8f9c14c8634ef91df8a64a244933667afb2509a6950e49b809f173cc5be1b58", "ja": "なんと。私の父と、萩原さんのお父さん……\nふたりも、アイドルのお父さんが揃ってしまうとは。", "zh": "竟然会这样。我的父亲和萩原小姐的父亲……\n没想到两位偶像的父亲竟然齐聚一堂。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_03_1048_mizukinotiti", "source_sha256": "5b8bd0fcb29c0da400cb50cd4e3ddb215d37050b29f459bfb23a458a01353ae9", "ja": "初めまして。私、そこにおります\n真壁瑞希の父で……こういう者です。", "zh": "初次见面。我是……在那里的\n真壁瑞希的父亲……是这样的人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_03_1049_yukihof", "source_sha256": "3141fdee57b2d0d8d2ae1f7adbbe514f55de1d3f2c3eb32eb132a8b971ab7dd0", "ja": "これはどうも、ご丁寧に。うちの娘と\n仲良くしてくださって、ありがとうございます。", "zh": "哎呀，您太客气了。谢谢您愿意和我家女儿好好相处。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_03_1050_yukihof", "source_sha256": "076fde569394bfcc7ba9080be8afd6ea82a17def0955d6bf27e5112ed305aa05", "ja": "大人しくて引っ込み思案な娘ですが、\nこれからもよろしくお願いします。", "zh": "这孩子性格内向又认生，\n今后也请您多多关照。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_03_1051_004yuk", "source_sha256": "729ea9985649b88f875c9b7f61abe835be46c2eee4b948b29042eca23bcdf2e2", "ja": "お、お父さん！\n変なこと言わないで……！", "zh": "爸、爸爸！  \n别说奇怪的话……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_03_1052_004yuk", "source_sha256": "81b2532c536ea52090b66a2625f2f07ea415ece4f4c6563de4a1e4164b1d2a29", "ja": "うう……アイドルのステージを\n見られるよりずっと恥ずかしいかも……。", "zh": "呜呜……感觉比被人看到偶像的舞台表演还要羞耻……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_03_1053_mizukinotiti", "source_sha256": "22343ef74ba1104d2a442a263f1e9cc388e01eadcefc94d98f7c86b4f74d6e48", "ja": "こちらこそ、うちの瑞希を\n今後ともよろしくお願いいたします。", "zh": "我才要请您今后继续多多关照我们家瑞希。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_03_1054_p", "source_sha256": "18594c5ef430461ac6561341ebd0216a9e197d74baf5fb0f2dec2d97d83db7af", "ja": "（お父さん同士の名刺交換が始まってしまった……。\nこれはこれで、なかなかレアな光景だ）", "zh": "（两位父亲开始交换名片了……\n这还真是相当罕见的场面啊）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
